flowchart LR
  G[Goal + exit condition] --> A[Act]
  A --> O[Observe: tool output, tests, state]
  O --> J{Checker passes?}
  J -- yes --> X[Exit: done]
  J -- no --> B{Budget or<br/>max 3 attempts left?}
  B -- yes --> D[Adjust: feed the failure back]
  D --> A
  B -- no --> E[Escalate to a human, fail loud]
